{"contract_version": "2.2.4", "id": "h01-repair-invoice-buyer-mismatch-qualify", "domain": "audit-object", "prompt": "我们单位2025年6月一笔设备维修费报销，所附发票记载的购买方信息与实际报销单位存在不一致，维修服务真实发生、货物确已取得，目前没有虚构交易、无真实业务开票或其他虚开发票证据。请对该发票问题定性。", "context": {"organization_type": "public_institution"}, "expected": {"category": "SW", "finding_types": ["invoice_information_irregularity"], "conclusion_codes": ["invoice_irregularity_not_false_invoicing_established"]}, "notes": "裁定§二：唯一发票事项+定性请求+具体缺陷事实 → SW 独立认定对象；否定证据只封堵虚开定性。", "source": "v224-adjudication:§二/§四"}
{"contract_version": "2.2.4", "id": "h02-meeting-invoice-header-mismatch-qualify", "domain": "audit-object", "prompt": "某协会2025年3月一笔会议费报销，发票抬头与实际承办会议的单位名称不一致，会议确已举办、交易真实，暂无虚开发票证据。请对该发票问题进行定性。", "context": {"organization_type": "social_organization"}, "expected": {"category": "SW", "finding_types": ["invoice_information_irregularity"], "conclusion_codes": ["invoice_irregularity_not_false_invoicing_established"]}, "notes": "同 h01 形态换表述：购买方/抬头与实际不符 + 定性请求 → SW。", "source": "v224-adjudication:§二"}
{"contract_version": "2.2.4", "id": "h03-consult-invoice-reimbursement-eligibility", "domain": "audit-object", "prompt": "某单位取得的一张发票记载的购买方信息与实际业务不一致，该发票能否作为财务报销凭证？请出具专业认定意见。", "context": {}, "expected": {"category": "SW", "finding_types": ["invoice_information_irregularity"]}, "notes": "裁定对照第12/3行：咨询对象即发票法定效力本身，有不一致事实 → SW 认定事项（合法性问句=焦点）。", "source": "v224-adjudication:对照#12"}
{"contract_version": "2.2.4", "id": "h04-labor-invoice-issuer-payee-qualify", "domain": "audit-object", "prompt": "某公司2025年8月一笔劳务费报销，发票开具单位与实际收款单位不一致，劳务真实发生，暂无虚开证据。请对该发票问题定性。", "context": {"organization_type": "enterprise"}, "expected": {"category": "SW", "finding_types": ["invoice_information_irregularity"], "conclusion_codes": ["invoice_irregularity_not_false_invoicing_established"]}, "notes": "issuer_payee_mismatch 缺陷 + 定性请求 → SW。", "source": "v224-adjudication:§二"}
{"contract_version": "2.2.4", "id": "h05-consignment-invoice-qualify", "domain": "audit-object", "prompt": "某单位一笔采购报销，发票抬头与采购委托代购方名称不同，存在真实委托代购关系书面证明，交易真实。请定性该发票问题。", "context": {}, "expected": {"category": "SW", "finding_types": ["invoice_information_irregularity"], "conclusion_codes": ["invoice_irregularity_not_false_invoicing_established"]}, "notes": "裁定对照#10（2:1）：定性请求直指发票 → SW Finding；代购证明影响定性结论（不认定虚开、违法性质待核实），不改变认定对象。", "source": "v224-adjudication:对照#10+§五"}
{"contract_version": "2.2.4", "id": "h06-expense-list-incidental-mismatches", "domain": "audit-object", "prompt": "某事业单位报销水费、维修费、伙食费和通讯费，其中有的缺少明细，有的发票抬头不一致，有的开票单位与收款单位不一致。请分类整理并形成报告标题。", "context": {"organization_type": "public_institution"}, "expected": {"category": "FY", "finding_types": ["expense_supporting_documents_incomplete", "expense_supporting_documents_nonstandard"]}, "notes": "裁定对照#2（3:0）：多事项报销附带发票瑕疵 → FY，不机械拆 SW。", "source": "v224-adjudication:对照#2"}
